ers through heartbeat, recovery (handle the permanent loss of a tablet server) based on WAL (write-ahead log) and metadata, and start/kill the servers. The tablet servers support garbage collection (only keep the last five inserted values), maintaining the memtable for effective searching (memtable would spilled to disk when there are a hundred unique row keys exists), maintaining the in-memory indexes, sharding when a table contains more than 1000 row keys, WAL, reconstructing the tablet server state using WAL and SSTables maintained in the persistent storage, effective range searching in SSTables.","topics":[],"score":259128,"global_rank":50266,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":9383},{"name":"layertwo/vsplunk","owner":"layertwo","html_url":"https://github.com/layertwo/vsplunk","stars":2,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Splunk app for VisiData","topics":["analysis","logs","security-tools","splunk","terminal","visidata"],"score":259128,"global_rank":50268,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":9384},{"name":"nwfsc-fram/pyDidson","owner":"nwfsc-fram","html_url":"https://github.com/nwfsc-fram/pyDidson","stars":2,"forks":0,"watchers":2,"issues":2,"language":"Python","description":"Python library for reading Soundmetrics DIDSON sonar video","topics":[],"score":259122,"global_rank":50278,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":9385},{"name":"gstoica27/cpg_ppo","owner":"gstoica27","html_url":"https://github.com/gstoica27/cpg_ppo","stars":1,"forks":1,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":259120,"global_rank":50283,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":9386},{"name":"vimichael/Unique-Dungeon-Shooter-Game","owner":"vimichael","html_url":"https://github.com/vimichael/Unique-Dungeon-Shooter-Game","stars":2,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"WIP - Dungeon shooter game using pygame","topics":[],"score":259115,"global_rank":50288,